        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Describe revoked Ollama API keys accurately",
        "body": "## Summary\n- describe rejected Ollama keys as invalid or revoked\n- remove the inaccurate claim that Ollama API keys expire\n- document the provider key lifecycle\n\n## Proof\n\nDeterministic test run on this branch (injected HTTP transport — no network, no credentials):\n\n```text\n$ swift test --disable-sandbox --filter OllamaUsageFetcherTests\n◇ Test \"api authorization error describes revocation\" started.\n✔ Test \"api authorization error describes revocation\" passed\n✔ Test run with 19 tests in 1 suite passed.\n```\n\nThe `apiUnauthorized` error now reads `Ollama API key is invalid or revoked.`, matching Ollama's non-expiring key lifecycle (keys do not expire; they are revoked from the key settings page).\n\n## Testing\n- `swift test --disable-sandbox --filter OllamaUsageFetcherTests` (19 passed)\n- `swift build` clean\n",
